	(203,'Abacha','01JKAF6MVDD4AA6ZDNRSJHMFE6.png',3,5,'Abacha is a traditional dish from the Igbo people of southeastern Nigeria. Often referred to as \"Nigerian salad\" or \"African salad,\" it is made from Abacha (dried shredded cassava), which is soaked in water to soften.',NULL,'2024-11-25 12:20:32','2025-02-05 07:11:45'),
	(204,'avocado','01JKAF8EMXCZY69RZBQZN79XZE.png',4,6,'Avocado is a creamy, nutrient-dense fruit native to Central and South America. It has a green, rough skin, and its flesh is pale yellow or green with a large seed in the center. Known for its mild, buttery flavor and smooth texture, avocado is rich in healthy fats, particularly monounsaturated fat, which supports heart health.',NULL,'2024-11-25 12:43:03','2025-02-05 07:12:44'),
	(205,'Bell pepper','01JDHP5W7X7N7TR5F4KEV7GEH8.jpeg',4,19,'Bell peppers (Capsicum annuum) are fruits that belong to the nightshade family. They are low in calories and rich in vitamin C and other',NULL,'2024-11-25 12:54:10','2025-01-20 05:30:17'),
	(206,'scent leaves','01JDHPG9J2P1B90ZPQJBHA311H.jpeg',4,18,'Scent Leaf is a flavorful herb from Nigeria and Ghana, where it is used in various dishes, including Pepper Soup and Black Soup.',NULL,'2024-11-25 12:59:51','2024-12-09 12:43:38'),
	(207,'ugu','01JDHPZX2QJBKT0ZPD1T0MGW5M.jpeg',4,6,'Ugu Fluted Pumpkin leaves are rich in dietary properties like calcium, iron, potassium, and manganese. The leaves is a very rich source of fiber, minerals',NULL,'2024-11-25 13:08:22','2024-11-25 13:08:22'),
	(208,'afang leaf','01JKAF7J6Y7TF38WJDRE6GFFEG.png',4,18,'fang leaves are a good source of dietary fiber. These dark green vegetables are rich in folate',NULL,'2024-11-25 13:20:31','2025-02-05 07:12:15'),
	(209,'yam','01JDS7FDQFQK6EEDRB28WM3TPD.jpg',4,22,'ams are starchy staples in the form of large tubers produced by annual and perennial vines grown in Africa, the Americas, the Caribbean, South Pacific and Asia. There are hundreds of wild and domesticated Dioscorea species.',NULL,'2024-11-28 11:11:09','2024-12-09 12:43:49'),
