	(716,'yeast','01JJPPEAAH1MPE7XQNX2VRBFVE.jpg',1,4,'Yeast enables natural fermentation that is used for making bread, beer, and other fermented food. Nutritional yeast is a good source of proteins, minerals, and vitamins. Yeast extracts can be used in the food and beverage industry to improve the taste of dishes.',NULL,'2025-01-28 14:53:28','2025-01-28 14:53:28'),
	(717,'vanilla flavour','01JJPPHXFXEXTFW7HM777AZ4N3.jpg',1,6,'Vanilla extract is a solution made by macerating and percolating vanilla pods in a solution of ethanol and water. It is considered an essential ingredient in many Western desserts, especially baked goods like cakes, cookies, brownies, and cupcakes, as well as custards, ice creams, and puddings',NULL,'2025-01-28 14:55:26','2025-01-28 14:55:26'),
